# T6b. The host calls its own model as C before the return: the model is walked, its native
# function returns 0. A call is a frame head, not an atom. Refused, located.
fn: makeAdder (int: n) fn: (int: x) int
    int: q (addN: 1)
    fn: addN (int: x) int
        return: n + x
    return: addN

add5: makeAdder 5
int: a (add5: 1)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: a; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
